  "notes": "Dark-mode desktop-style game data editor. Section panels follow a consistent template: small blue eyebrow (身份/外观/战斗/成长/关系), bold title, grey description, divider, then right-aligned key–value rows separated by hairlines; header action buttons are small outlined. Pixel-art character portraits (retro game sprites) are the only imagery; NPCs without art fall back to emoji 👤. Selected list row uses #2d3852 fill with a blue left accent. Inspector tabs are segmented with blue outline on active. Status bar at bottom reports diagnostics and save state. Tooltips include keyboard shortcuts (⌘⌥L, ⌘Z). Editing tab uses numeric stepper inputs (−/+)."
